  "22:11": {
    "inputs": {
      "value": "subject_definitions:\n<Subject 1> is the warrior in <Picture 1>, a stocky broad-shouldered fighter with a weathered face, short dark beard, and wind-tousled dark hair, wearing scuffed leather-and-bronze plate armor under a thick fur-trimmed cloak.\n<Subject 2> is the misty rocky ridge in <Picture 2>, with jagged grey stone outcrops, tattered cloth banners staked into the ground, and low fog drifting across the surface.\n<Subject 3> is the pair of bolster pillows in <Picture 3>, soft cylindrical shapes with a faded striped fabric pattern and visibly creased, worn seams, each with one end gathered like a blade's hilt, resting on the ground like legendary relic weapons.\n\nsummary:\n[reference generation] The target video shows <Subject 1> standing atop <Subject 2>, turning toward the horizon, then closing their grip on the hilt-end of <Subject 3> with the weight and reverence of drawing legendary blades and raising them overhead, while an off-screen narrator speaks.\n\nretention_analysis:\n<Subject 1> (appears in [Shot 1], [Shot 2]): fully_preserved - armor, cloak, beard, and build are retained throughout.\n<Subject 2> (appears in [Shot 1]): fully_preserved - rocky outcrops, banners, and drifting fog are retained.\n<Subject 3> (appears in [Shot 2]): fully_preserved - the soft striped fabric and rumpled seams are retained exactly as referenced, never rigid or metallic, gripped only by the gathered end.\n\ndetailed_description:\nThe target video is in a cinematic epic-fantasy game-trailer style, with dramatic warm backlighting, richly detailed textures, and a painterly amber color grade.\n[Shot 1] A wide low-angle static shot frames <Subject 2>, the misty rocky ridge, its jagged outcrops catching the low golden sun through drifting fog, tattered banners snapping in the wind. <Subject 1> stands center frame, back three-quarters to camera, then turns their profile toward the horizon, jaw set, eyes narrowed against the light, cloak pulled by the wind. An off-screen narrator (S1), in a deep, weathered bass-baritone voice, native French speaker, speaking at an extremely slow and deliberate pace with heavy pauses, entirely without warmth, says, <d>[French] Dans un monde où le sommeil est une arme.</d>\n[Shot 2] At 00:04.000, the camera pushes in from a low angle toward <Subject 1>, who crouches beside <Subject 3>, the two bolster pillows on the ground, and closes each hand tightly around the gathered hilt-end of one pillow, gripping it exactly as a warrior's hand would close around the hilt of a legendary blade, never touching the loose trailing length. They rise to full height and lift <Subject 3> together directly overhead by these hilt-ends, arms locked, cloak billowing outward, the loose fabric trailing down from each grip like the blunted length of a blade. Expression stays completely grave — no glance toward camera, no smile.\n\noverall_soundscape:\nA steady, gusting wind continues throughout, with the intermittent snap of loose banner fabric.\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\nA low sustained orchestral chord swells through Shot 1, joined by a sharp orchestral sting exactly as the grip closes at the start of Shot 2, building to a peak on the overhead raise."
    },
